%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a pass-through image. An eight-bit image in the XYZ space,
% which collapses to CalRGB with unit gammas and the identity matrix,
% keeps its samples; without a Decode entry the samples map onto the
% space's RangeABC, which the image carries as its decode array.
[/CIEBasedABC <<
  /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089]
  /RangeABC [0 0.9505 0 1 0 1]
  /RangeLMN [0 0.9505 0 1 0 1]
>>] setcolorspace
gsave
100 100 translate 200 200 scale
<< /ImageType 1 /Width 2 /Height 2 /BitsPerComponent 8
   /ImageMatrix [2 0 0 -2 0 2]
   /DataSource <ff0000 00ff00 0000ff 808080>
>> image
grestore
showpage
